# CI 构建上下文瘦身 + 凭证卫生(Dockerfile 只 COPY 声明的路径,
# 但 build context 会整个发给 docker daemon:k8s dind 下 .venv/.git 白传几十 MB,
# config.local.json / manifests/ 含真实凭证,不该进 context)
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
design
scripts
manifests
config.local.json
.env
*.local
consumer_types.csv
*.db
